(7570916, 1215369, 77192, '<td valign="top">My pick for a ribbon, great idea, well executed. The only thing is Im a little concerned as to the gap where the head should be - I feel the right hand side of the collar should be more visible. But overall, thanks for a good picture which made me smile.</td>', 'My pick for a ribbon, great idea, well executed. The only thing is Im a little concerned as to the gap where the head should be - I feel the right hand side of the collar should be more visible. But overall, thanks for a good picture which made me smile.', '2018-06-08 19:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
