(7571055, 1215268, 3306, '<td valign="top">This was an interesting challenge. I found myself looking at the pictures and judging my emotional reaction to the picture as opposed to looking at it from a technical point of view. Your composition has hit the nail on the head. I found myself taking a deep breath the moment I saw it even without seeing the title. Wonderful interpretation of a difficult challenge.10</td>', 'This was an interesting challenge. I found myself looking at the pictures and judging my emotional reaction to the picture as opposed to looking at it from a technical point of view. Your composition has hit the nail on the head. I found myself taking a deep breath the moment I saw it even without seeing the title. Wonderful interpretation of a difficult challenge.10', '2018-06-10 08:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
