(7571829, 1215268, 173844, '<td valign="top">So many fine and intriguing images in this challenge, yet I have only a bit of time available to comment.  This is a terrific photo, my favorite, and to not celebrate it is unthinkable.  This person seems to be both floating and falling, possible in dreams and the fleeting insights of everyday life, in the sneaky folds of the subconscious. The generous overlays and whatnot create the isolation in which suggestion flourishes.  There''s a feeling of calm, fearless acceptance, wherein grace is accorded the initiate.  The moment of transition.  Like a new constellation in the firmament.  Okay, please pardon the shameless gushing.  Good stuff.</td>', 'So many fine and intriguing images in this challenge, yet I have only a bit of time available to comment.  This is a terrific photo, my favorite, and to not celebrate it is unthinkable.  This person seems to be both floating and falling, possible in dreams and the fleeting insights of everyday life, in the sneaky folds of the subconscious. The generous overlays and whatnot create the isolation in which suggestion flourishes.  There''s a feeling of calm, fearless acceptance, wherein grace is accorded the initiate.  The moment of transition.  Like a new constellation in the firmament.  Okay, please pardon the shameless gushing.  Good stuff.', '2018-06-15 00:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
